 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "There's an empty chair beside me and the evening light is thin",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I have held a hand grown cold now, I have let the silence in",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But I have not been left with nothing, though my eyes are wet with grief",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a word that holds me steady like an anchor underneath",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As you trust in him",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So that you may overflow with hope",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "By the power of the Holy Spirit",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In his great mercy he has given us new birth into a living hope",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the resurrection of Jesus Christ from the dead",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The stone is rolled away, and the morning light has come",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May the God of hope fill you with all joy and peace",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
